#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:2
msgid "Debayering"
msgstr "去拜耳化（Debayering）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:4
msgid ""
"The raw Bayer frame carries only one colour channel per pixel. Turning it "
"into a normal three-channel RGB image means filling in the two missing "
"channels at every pixel by interpolating from nearby pixels of the right "
"colour. That interpolation is *debayering* (also called demosaicing). A "
"handful of algorithm families dominate."
msgstr ""
"原始的 Bayer 影格在每個像素上只攜帶一個色彩通道。要把它轉換成正常的三通道 RGB "
"影像，意味著要透過從鄰近正確色彩的像素內插，來補上每個像素缺少的那兩個通道。這種內插就是 *去拜耳化*\\ "
"（debayering，也稱為去馬賽克化）。主流的演算法家族只有少數幾種。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:12
msgid "Super-pixel"
msgstr "超像素（Super-pixel）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:14
msgid ""
"The cheapest approach collapses every 2x2 Bayer tile -- one red cell, one "
"blue cell, and two green cells -- into a single output pixel:"
msgstr "最便宜的做法是把每一個 2x2 的 Bayer 方塊（一個紅色格、一個藍色格，以及兩個綠色格）合併成單一個輸出像素："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:18
msgid "the red channel is the red cell's value;"
msgstr "紅色通道取自紅色格的值；"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:19
msgid "the blue channel is the blue cell's value;"
msgstr "藍色通道取自藍色格的值；"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:20
msgid "the green channel is the average of the two green cells."
msgstr "綠色通道取兩個綠色格的平均值。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:22
msgid ""
"Each 2x2 input tile becomes one output pixel, so the finished image is half "
"the width and half the height of the sensor, with a quarter of the pixel "
"count. Super-pixel is fast and free of interpolation artefacts, but the "
"resolution cost makes it a last resort -- it is rarely used."
msgstr ""
"每個 2x2 "
"的輸入方塊變成一個輸出像素，因此完成後的影像寬度與高度都只有感測器的一半，像素數量只剩四分之一。超像素法速度快且不會產生內插假影，但解析度的代價使它成為最後的手段，很少被使用。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:30
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "雙線性（Bilinear）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:32
msgid ""
"*Bilinear* interpolation averages the nearest pixels of the right colour "
"rather than copying or summarising. The exact averaging depends on which "
"colour the centre pixel records, because the four cases distribute the "
"missing channels around the 3x3 neighbourhood differently."
msgstr ""
"*雙線性* 內插會對最近的正確色彩像素取平均，而非直接複製或概括。實際的平均方式取決於中心像素記錄的是哪種色彩，因為這四種情況在 3x3 "
"鄰域中分布缺少通道的方式各不相同。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Green pixel in a red-green row.** The missing red value averages the two "
"red neighbours to the left and right; the missing blue averages the two blue"
" neighbours above and below."
msgstr "**紅綠列中的綠色像素。** 缺少的紅色值取左右兩個紅色鄰居的平均；缺少的藍色取上下兩個藍色鄰居的平均。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:43
msgid ""
"A 3 column by 3 row Bayer-pattern neighbourhood\n"
"centred on a green pixel in a red-green row. The\n"
"cells to the left and right of the centre are\n"
"red; the cells above and below are blue; the\n"
"corner cells are green. White arrows point inward\n"
"from the two red cells and the two blue cells\n"
"into the centre."
msgstr ""
"一個 3 欄乘 3 列的 Bayer 圖樣鄰域，\n"
"以紅綠列中的一個綠色像素為中心。中心\n"
"左右兩邊的格子是紅色；上下兩邊的格子\n"
"是藍色；四個角落的格子是綠色。白色箭頭\n"
"從兩個紅色格與兩個藍色格向內指向\n"
"中心。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:43
msgid ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-green-rg.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-green-rg.svg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:52
msgid ""
"The missing red comes from the horizontal red neighbours; the missing blue "
"from the vertical blue neighbours."
msgstr "缺少的紅色來自水平方向的紅色鄰居；缺少的藍色來自垂直方向的藍色鄰居。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Green pixel in a green-blue row.** Same shape with red and blue swapped. "
"The missing red value averages the two red neighbours above and below; the "
"missing blue averages the two blue neighbours to the left and right."
msgstr "**綠藍列中的綠色像素。** 形狀相同，但紅色與藍色對調。缺少的紅色值取上下兩個紅色鄰居的平均；缺少的藍色取左右兩個藍色鄰居的平均。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:61
msgid ""
"A 3 column by 3 row Bayer-pattern neighbourhood\n"
"centred on a green pixel in a green-blue row. The\n"
"cells above and below the centre are red; the\n"
"cells to the left and right are blue; the corner\n"
"cells are green. White arrows point inward from\n"
"the two red cells and the two blue cells into the\n"
"centre."
msgstr ""
"一個 3 欄乘 3 列的 Bayer 圖樣鄰域，\n"
"以綠藍列中的一個綠色像素為中心。中心\n"
"上下兩邊的格子是紅色；左右兩邊的格子\n"
"是藍色；四個角落的格子是綠色。白色箭頭\n"
"從兩個紅色格與兩個藍色格向內指向\n"
"中心。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:61
msgid ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-green-gb.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-green-gb.svg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:70
msgid ""
"The missing red comes from the vertical red neighbours; the missing blue "
"from the horizontal blue neighbours."
msgstr "缺少的紅色來自垂直方向的紅色鄰居；缺少的藍色來自水平方向的藍色鄰居。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Red pixel.** The missing green value averages the four cardinal green "
"neighbours (above, below, left, right). The missing blue averages the four "
"diagonal blue neighbours."
msgstr "**紅色像素。** 缺少的綠色值取四個正交方向綠色鄰居（上、下、左、右）的平均。缺少的藍色取四個對角線藍色鄰居的平均。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:77
msgid ""
"A 3 column by 3 row Bayer-pattern neighbourhood\n"
"centred on a red pixel. The four cardinal\n"
"neighbours (above, below, left, right) are green;\n"
"the four diagonal corner cells are blue. White\n"
"arrows point inward from all eight neighbours\n"
"into the centre."
msgstr ""
"一個 3 欄乘 3 列的 Bayer 圖樣鄰域，\n"
"以一個紅色像素為中心。四個正交方向的\n"
"鄰居（上、下、左、右）是綠色；四個對角線\n"
"角落的格子是藍色。白色箭頭從全部八個\n"
"鄰居向內指向中心。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:77
msgid ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-red.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-red.svg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:85
msgid ""
"The missing green comes from the four cardinal green neighbours; the missing"
" blue from the four diagonal blue neighbours."
msgstr "缺少的綠色來自四個正交方向的綠色鄰居；缺少的藍色來自四個對角線藍色鄰居。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Blue pixel.** Mirror of the red case. The missing green averages the four "
"cardinal green neighbours, and the missing red averages the four diagonal "
"red neighbours."
msgstr "**藍色像素。** 紅色情況的鏡像。缺少的綠色取四個正交方向綠色鄰居的平均，缺少的紅色取四個對角線紅色鄰居的平均。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:93
msgid ""
"A 3 column by 3 row Bayer-pattern neighbourhood\n"
"centred on a blue pixel. The four cardinal\n"
"neighbours are green; the four diagonal corner\n"
"cells are red. White arrows point inward from all\n"
"eight neighbours into the centre."
msgstr ""
"一個 3 欄乘 3 列的 Bayer 圖樣鄰域，\n"
"以一個藍色像素為中心。四個正交方向的\n"
"鄰居是綠色；四個對角線角落的格子是\n"
"紅色。白色箭頭從全部八個鄰居向內\n"
"指向中心。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:93
msgid ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-blue.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/debayer-blue.svg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:100
msgid ""
"The missing green comes from the four cardinal green neighbours; the missing"
" red from the four diagonal red neighbours."
msgstr "缺少的綠色來自四個正交方向的綠色鄰居；缺少的紅色來自四個對角線紅色鄰居。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:104
msgid ""
"Bilinear keeps the sensor's full resolution and is smooth enough for most "
"uses, but it still shows artefacts at edges. A sharp transition between two "
"colours crosses the pixel grid in a particular orientation, and averaging "
"across the edge softens it slightly. Where the colour and luminance edges do"
" not line up exactly, faint coloured fringes appear in the output."
msgstr ""
"雙線性法保留了感測器的完整解析度，且對大多數用途來說已足夠平滑，但它在邊緣處仍會顯現假影。兩種色彩之間的銳利轉變會以特定的方向穿越像素網格，而跨越邊緣取平均會使其略微變得柔和。在色彩邊緣與亮度邊緣未精確對齊之處，輸出中便會出現淡淡的色彩條紋。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:113
msgid "Beyond bilinear"
msgstr "超越雙線性"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:115
msgid ""
"A range of better debayer algorithms exists. Some use larger neighbourhoods "
"than bilinear's small cross of same-colour neighbours and weigh the samples "
"with more carefully chosen coefficients; others detect the direction of "
"local edges and bias the interpolation along that direction so an edge "
"running across the pixel grid stays sharp instead of softening. Either "
"approach reduces the colour fringes and edge softening bilinear leaves "
"behind, at the cost of more arithmetic per pixel and more silicon (or more "
"compute on the MCU side)."
msgstr ""
"存在一系列更優秀的去拜耳演算法。有些使用比雙線性那種同色鄰居小十字更大的鄰域，並以更謹慎挑選的係數對樣本加權；有些則偵測局部邊緣的方向，並讓內插偏向沿著該方向進行，使橫越像素網格的邊緣保持銳利而不會變柔和。這兩種做法都能減少雙線性遺留下來的色彩條紋與邊緣柔化，但代價是每個像素需要更多運算，以及更多的矽晶片資源（或"
" MCU 端更多的運算量）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:126
msgid ""
"The debayer quality available on any given OpenMV Cam is platform-specific "
"-- it depends on what the sensor and MCU on that camera provide."
msgstr "任一台特定 OpenMV Cam 上可用的去拜耳品質是平台相依的，取決於該相機上的感測器與 MCU 所提供的能力。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:131
msgid "Where debayering runs"
msgstr "去拜耳化在哪裡執行"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:133
msgid ""
"The *image signal processor* (ISP) -- on the sensor chip itself or on the "
"MCU side -- debayers each frame before it leaves the imaging pipeline in "
"most cases. User code receives a finished three-channel RGB image without "
"ever touching the raw mosaic."
msgstr ""
"*影像訊號處理器*\\ （ISP）位於感測器晶片本身或 MCU "
"端，在多數情況下會於每個影格離開影像處理流程之前進行去拜耳化。使用者程式碼接收到的是完成的三通道 RGB 影像，完全不必接觸原始的馬賽克資料。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/debayering.rst:139
msgid ""
"The ISP can also be told to pass the raw Bayer frame through unchanged. Raw "
"Bayer takes less memory than the debayered image -- one byte per pixel "
"versus three -- which makes it useful when frame storage is the bottleneck, "
"when capturing for off-line processing, or when the project wants to apply a"
" custom debayer algorithm in software."
msgstr ""
"ISP 也可以被設定為讓原始的 Bayer 影格原封不動地通過。原始 Bayer "
"所占用的記憶體比去拜耳化後的影像少，每個像素一個位元組而非三個，這使得它在影格儲存成為瓶頸時、為離線處理進行擷取時，或當專案想以軟體套用自訂去拜耳演算法時相當有用。"
